          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can I plug my 50 amp RV into a 30 amp generator?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes, with a 50-to-30-amp adapter, but the RV will only have about 3,600 watts available. That is enough for one air conditioner and light loads, not for two air conditioners. For full use of a 50-amp RV, you need a generator or parallel pair with a 50-amp outlet."
          }
        },
