          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Size the generator for the air conditioner's starting surge, or fit a soft start and buy smaller. Check each campground's noise rules and generator hours, run the generator well away from the RV with the exhaust pointed away, and keep the carbon monoxide alarm working.
